                        "glosses": [
                            "Greyhound racing: the jolly dogs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddbcbe94-2375-4005-adcb-80ddfddf67fa",
                                "sense_id": "57dae95e-319a-3c25-ad0d-95be60682f33",
                                "text": "But even wooden limbs get tired/ And want a change of play/ So \"Golliwogg\"/ A \"jolly dog\"/ Suggests they run away."
